{"heroId":64,"art":{"card":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/drifter_card.webp","background":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/backgrounds/drifter_bg.webp","vertical":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/drifter_vertical.webp"},"text":{"en":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"An ancient vampire roaming across America, the nameless monstrosity known as The Drifter has been preying on the living for generations.\n\nUnlike most vampires, Drifter doesn’t value finery or titles and has naked contempt for vampiric laws and tradition.  This refusal to toe the line has made him a marked man all over the North American Baronies; but while Viscounts and Elders cry for his execution, Drifter continues to do what he pleases...","tags":["Stalker","Bloodthirsty","Cruel"]},"es":{"role":"","playstyle":"","lore":"Como antiguo vampiro que deambula por Estados Unidos, la monstruosidad sin nombre conocida como el Vagabundo lleva generaciones alimentándose de los vivos.\n\nA diferencia de la mayoría de los vampiros, al Vagabundo no le interesan ni los lujos ni los títulos y siente un desprecio absoluto por las leyes y tradiciones vampíricas. Su negativa a acatar las normas lo ha convertido en un proscrito en todas las baronías de Norteamérica, pero mientras los vizcondes y ancianos claman por su ejecución, el Vagabundo sigue haciendo lo que le da la gana…","tags":["Acechador","Sanguinario","Cruel"]}},"abilities":{"en":[{"id":3120550633,"slot":1,"ultimate":false,"name":"Rend","img":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/drifter/drifter_claw.webp","quip":[],"sections":[{"text":[{"t":"Swipe at enemies in a cone ahead of you, dealing "},{"t":"spirit damage","attr":"SpiritDamage","icon":"attr_SpiritDamage"},{"t":". If the enemy is in "},{"t":"close range","hi":true},{"t":", deal bonus "},{"t":"melee damage","attr":"MeleeDamage","icon":"attr_MeleeDamage"},{"t":"